# Azure app registration for the OneDrive workbook import (v2.6.0) — placeholders only.
#
# Copy this file to `.env` in the repository root and replace the three placeholders with the values
# from Azure Portal -> App registrations -> <your app>:
#
#   Application_ID   Overview      -> Application (client) ID
#   Directory_ID     Overview      -> Directory (tenant) ID
#   Redirect_URL     Authentication -> the Android platform redirect URI
#                                   (msauth://<package>/<signature-hash>, or msal<client-id>://auth)
#
# `.env` is git-ignored. It is never written into a tracked file, a build log, a report or an APK
# asset: `app/build.gradle.kts` reads it and generates the configuration under the module's build
# directory. Without a `.env` the build still succeeds and uses the placeholders below.
#
# Account type: personal Microsoft accounts only. Delegated permission: Microsoft Graph `Files.Read`.
# This is a public client (authorization code + PKCE): never add a client secret to this app.

Application_ID=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Directory_ID=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Redirect_URL=msal00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000://auth
